CHANGELOG.md:67:  export a conversation — or its AI summary — to **Notion** (a new page under your
CHANGELOG.md:69:  **Obsidian** (a `Vesti/<title>.md` file with frontmatter). Plus per-message
CHANGELOG.md:93:- **One-click prompt backup**: export/import the prompt library as a JSON file
CHANGELOG.md:103:- Added message-sidecar metadata for structured citations and artifact presence.
CHANGELOG.md:106:  conversations (LLM-assisted titling/summary/scoring with heuristic fallback),
CHANGELOG.md:148:  export dialog, reader copy buttons, dock/card aria) and filled missing
CHANGELOG.md:160:- Unified citation stripping with structured source retention across capture, reader, and export.
CHANGELOG.md:164:  "kept zero messages", perf-mode switches) from `console.warn` to a new
CHANGELOG.md:175:  and scoped `DoubaoParser.isGenerating()` to message bubbles so persistent page
CHANGELOG.md:180:- Fixed "Import to Notes" from a summary card landing on a blank page — it now
CHANGELOG.md:187:- Fixed ChatGPT thinking UI so it no longer splits a single assistant reply into multiple logical messages.
CHANGELOG.md:194:  Added a one-time capture-path diagnostic and a `no_messages` skip log to make
CHANGELOG.md:210:- Added `documents/DEVELOPMENT_GUIDELINES.md` (architecture map, message-routing
CHANGELOG.md:255:- Realigned Kimi capture to the current DOM structure, excluded `chat-header` pollution, and restored cold-start transient availability.
CHANGELOG.md:342:- Expanded capsule primary rollout hosts from partial whitelist to all currently supported chat platforms (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, DeepSeek, Qwen, Doubao).
CHANGELOG.md:377:- Extension host permissions now include `https://gemini.google.com/*` and `https://chat.deepseek.com/*`.
CHANGELOG.md:378:- Extension host permissions now also include `https://www.doubao.com/*` and `https://chat.qwen.ai/*`.
CHANGELOG.md:384:- Timeline/Insights counters now display `X messages · Y turns`; Reader header now labels count as messages.
CHANGELOG.md:386:- Release-line governance is split into serial tracks: `v1.6` data pipeline, `v1.7` multi-agent/prompt backend, `v1.8` Reader+Insights UI.
CHANGELOG.md:388:- Thread Summary pipeline is now aligned to the latest skill contract while keeping `conversation_summary.v2` naming: parser and adapter support both legacy v2 shape and upgraded v2 shape (`thinking_journey[]`, `real_world_anchor`, glossary-style `key_insights[]`), and Insights Thread Summary UI now renders the full structured journey view with generation shell + no-flash regeneration behavior.
CHANGELOG.md:389:- Capture persistence upgraded to schema v5-compatible writes (`content_ast`, `content_ast_version`, `degraded_nodes_count`) with legacy-safe read defaults; Reader now uses hybrid AST-first rendering with plain-text fallback; JSON export now carries AST fields as optional extensions.
CHANGELOG.md:395:- Corrected turns/message mismatch in sidepanel views and active capture status snapshots.
CHANGELOG.md:396:- DeepSeek parser now supports `.ds-message`-based DOM (no `<main>` requirement), hybrid class role inference, and explicit `/a/chat/s/<id>` session path extraction.
CHANGELOG.md:417:- Added canonical v1.7 prompt files: `documents/prompt_engineering/thread-summary-skill.md` and `documents/prompt_engineering/weekly-digest-skill.md`.
CHANGELOG.md:423:- Aligned v1.7 planning docs to the new schema matrix: defaults `conversation_summary.v3` and `weekly_lite.v2`, with one-cycle legacy coexistence for `v2/v1`.
CHANGELOG.md:429:- Added `documents/ui_refactor/v1_8_2_thread_summary_ui_refactor_spec.md`.
CHANGELOG.md:430:- Added `documents/ui_refactor/v1_8_2_thread_summary_state_machine_contract.md`.
CHANGELOG.md:431:- Added `documents/ui_refactor/v1_8_2_thread_summary_manual_sampling_and_acceptance.md`.
CHANGELOG.md:448:- Added export serializer layer for `json/txt/md` with unified payload (`content`, `mime`, `filename`).
